
---
import Layout from "../Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | MakautNetwork"
  description="Read the terms for using MakautNetwork's academic calculators, resources, and website content."
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#071426] lg:px-4 lg:py-2 text-white px-6 py-16">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-400">
        Legal
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
        Terms of Use
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-400">Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>

      <p class="mt-6 leading-7 text-slate-300">
        These terms apply when you access or use MakautNetwork. By using the
        website, you agree to follow these terms. If you do not agree, please
        discontinue use of the website.
      </p>

      <section class="mt-9">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. About the website</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          MakautNetwork provides student-focused academic tools, educational
          resources, and university-related information. Features and content may
          change as the website develops.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Calculator results</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Our calculators are intended to help you estimate or check academic
          values. Results depend on the information you enter and the calculation
          method used by the tool.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Always check the applicable university regulations, official grade
          cards, and instructions from the relevant institution before using a
          result for an application, eligibility decision, or other official
          purpose.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Accuracy of information</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          We aim to provide useful and accurate information, but we cannot
          guarantee that every page, update, formula, link, or resource is
          complete, current, or error-free. Official university notices and
          regulations should take precedence over summaries or explanations on
          this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          You agree not to misuse the website, attempt to disrupt its operation,
          bypass security measures, introduce malicious code, or use the service
          for unlawful purposes. You must not attempt to gain unauthorized access
          to the website or its systems.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Unless otherwise stated, the original text, design, branding, and
          website code created for MakautNetwork belong to their respective
          rights holders. You may use the website for personal and educational
          purposes, but you must not republish or commercially exploit original
          content without permission where permission is required.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          University names, third-party trademarks, and external materials remain
          the property of their respective owners.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. External links</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          The website may link to external websites for additional information
          or services. We do not control those websites and are not responsible
          for their content, availability, or policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">7. Availability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          We may update, change, suspend, or remove features or content at any
          time. We do not guarantee uninterrupted availability or that every
          feature will work on every device or browser.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">8. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          The website is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis, to the
          extent permitted by applicable law. MakautNetwork is an independent
          resource and is not an official website of Maulana Abul Kalam Azad
          University of Technology (MAKAUT). The website does not issue official
          academic records or replace guidance from the university.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">9. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          To the extent permitted by applicable law, MakautNetwork is not liable
          for losses arising from reliance on website information, calculator
          results, temporary service interruptions, or third-party websites.
          Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot legally be
          excluded.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">10. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          We may revise these terms as the website changes. Updates will appear
          on this page with a revised date. Continued use of the website after
          an update means you are using the current version, subject to
          applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-9 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0d1e33] p-5">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          If you have a question about these terms, contact us by email.
        </p>
        <a
          href="mailto:contact@makaut.net"
          class="mt-3 inline-block font-medium text-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-200"
        >
          contact@makaut.net
        </a>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
